{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49502","headline":"临江仙 一 · 顾敻","name":"临江仙 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧染长空池似镜，倚楼闲望凝情。\n满衣红藕细香清。\n象牀珍簟，山障掩，玉琴横。\n暗想昔时欢笑事，如今赢得愁生。\n博山炉煖澹烟轻。\n蝉吟人静，残日傍，小窗明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}